Exceptions_and_Edge_Cases: Not explicitly covered in this chapter.

Concept_Name: Puppet
Core_Definition: A software framework used for configuration management.
Key_Actors: Puppet software framework; machines.
Operational_Workflow: The framework permits the creation of modules for configuring specific services and applying those modules to different machines as needed.
Rules_and_Constraints: Not explicitly covered in this chapter.
