Concept_Name: Tumblr Invisible Touch
Core_Definition: An automation system designed to handle the intake process for new hardware.
Key_Actors: Physical hardware; Baseboard Management Controller; Tumblr inventory system; network configuration software.
Operational_Workflow: The system automates the upgrading of firmware; it sets up the Baseboard Management Controller; it adds the new machine to the inventory system; it executes a multi-hour stress test; it configures the network.
