Concept_Name: Baseboard Management Controller (BMC)
Core_Definition: A hardware component in physical machines that is configured as part of an automated hardware intake process.
Key_Actors: The Tumblr Invisible Touch system; physical machines.
Operational_Workflow: The automated system upgrades the machine firmware; the system sets up the Baseboard Management Controller; the machine is added to an inventory system; a multi-hour stress test is performed; the network is configured.
