Concept_Name: inventory system
Core_Definition: A tracking system used to record physical machines during the hardware intake process and register software installations.
Key_Actors: The Tumblr Invisible Touch system; post-install scripts; asset manager.
Operational_Workflow: During hardware preparation a machine is automatically added to the inventory system after its firmware and BMC are configured; during the software installation step post-install scripts register the installation with an asset manager.
