Core_Definition: A functional requirement of the monitoring system that provides immediate notification of device issues.
Key_Actors: Monitoring system; SMS systems; pagers.
Operational_Workflow: The monitoring system tracks device attributes every minute and triggers immediate notifications via SMS or pagers when specific conditions are met.
Rules_and_Constraints: The system must support real-time alerting specifically via SMS and pagers.
